# LaTeX build byproducts: never tracked, but the blanket re-inclusion above
# pulls in whatever a local `latexmk`/`pdflatex` run happened to leave
# sitting in this real, tracked directory -- a stale main.aux/main.bbl from
# local testing got baked into a shipped image this way and crashed every
# fresh Demo session's first compile with a "missing \item" fatal error.
research_avatar/online_studio/demo_project/paper/*.aux
research_avatar/online_studio/demo_project/paper/*.bbl
research_avatar/online_studio/demo_project/paper/*.blg
research_avatar/online_studio/demo_project/paper/*.fdb_latexmk
research_avatar/online_studio/demo_project/paper/*.fls
